    ("Coconut Water Pineapple Cooler", "Filipino", 5, 0, 4, "750 ml|coconut water; 300 g|pineapple; 1|lime; 1 handful|mint", "Blend the pineapple with half the coconut water and strain / Stir in the rest with lime juice and torn mint and serve over ice"),
    ("Cold Brew Coffee", "American", 5, 0, 6, "100 g|coffee, coarsely ground; 1 l|water, cold; 1 pinch|salt", "Stir the coffee into the water, cover and leave 12 to 18 hours / Strain through a paper filter / Dilute 1:1 with water or milk over ice"),
